Goal: specify the module hierarchy that a broader len.l1 parser and loader will
eventually need to support.

Expected shape:
- folder paths map to module paths
- dotted imports map to nested folders
- contract declarations stay namespaced within their defining modules
- future local example corpora should be loadable as multi-file module trees,
  not only as isolated single-file samples

The sample files in this folder are intentionally ahead of the current loader.
Today the loader resolves imports from lang/l1 only. This subtree exists to make
the intended future import and namespace surface concrete.